# Endpoint that receives project enquiries as a JSON POST.
# Any service that accepts JSON works: Formspree, Web3Forms, Google Apps Script,
# an SMTP relay, or a small serverless function. Leave unset and the form
# validates but honestly reports that it cannot deliver.
#
# NOTE: this value is inlined into the static bundle at build time, so use a
# public submission endpoint only — never an API key or private credential.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=
